xls/{dslx,ir,codegen}: add per-channel fifo wrapper configuration

dslx:
```dslx
#[channel(depth=2, fifo_wrapper=my_custom_fifo)]
let (tx, rx) = chan<u32>("my_channel");
```

verilog:
```verilog
my_custom_fifo #(
  .Width(32),
  .Depth(2)
) my_channel_fifo (
  // ...
);
```
